strength, dielectric constant and volume resistance, low dielectric loss, good mechanical performance and dimension stability.</span><br/> <span style="color:#009900;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:16px;"> BOPET capacitor film also called PET Capacitor film,clear Polyester capacitor film,transparent Polyester capacitor film,</span><br/> <span style="color:#009900;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:16px;"> Thickness:3-12UM Width: 500,620,910,980,1010,1300 MM</span><br/> <span style="color:#009900;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:16px;"> Net weight per roll about: 50KGS/roll </span><br/> <span style="color:#009900;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:16px;"> Inner plastic tube core: 3'',6''(76MM ,152MM )</span><br/> <span style="color:#009900;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:16px;"> 2.) BOPET metalized VM/--Zn/Al capacitor film (Metallized BOPET Capacitor Film,sliver PET Capacitor film). Thickness:3-12UM Width: 500,620,910,980,1010,1300 MM</span></p> <p><br/></p>', '2026-09-06 20:58:45');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO cms_items (c_id, i_id, title, pic, content, addtime) VALUES (48, 197, 'BOPP white opaque film (BOPP pearlized film)', '../upload/image/20180922/20180922163533_77736.jpg', '<p></p><p><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"><strong>BOPP white opaque film (BOPP pearlized film)</strong></span></p> <p><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"><strong><img alt="" src="../upload/image/20180829/20180829115230_13320.jpg"/><img alt="" src="../upload/image/20180829/20180829115231_23526.jpg"/><img alt="" src="../upload/image/20180829/20180829115232_64212.jpg"/><img alt="" src="../upload/image/20180829/20180829115232_39157.jpg"/><img alt="" src="../upload/image/20180829/20180829115233_15578.jpg"/><img alt="" src="../upload/image/20180829/20180829115233_30775.jpg"/><img alt="" src="../upload/image/20180829/20180829115234_82147.jpg"/><img alt="" src="../upload/image/20180829/20180829115234_71089.jpg"/><img alt="" src="../upload/image/20180829/20180829115234_38207.jpg"/><img alt="" src="../upload/image/20180829/20180829115234_10661.jpg"/></strong></span></p> <p><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"><strong><br/> </strong></span></p> <p><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"><strong><br/> </strong></span></p>', '2026-09-06 20:58:45');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO cms_items (c_id, i_id, title, pic, content, addtime) VALUES (48, 193, 'BOPP Matte film (15,18,20 microns) matt Polypropylene film', '../', '<p></p><p>BOPP Matte film (15,18,20 microns) matt Polypropylene film</p> <p>BOPP Matte film were like paper and kerchief.<br/> Thickness:12,15,17,18,20,25,30,35 microns <br/> Width: 325-1800MM Length :3000-9000M <br/> Inner paper tube core :3"(76MM) ,6" (152MM)<br/> Character: : Inner side matte (as its standard), Two side corona treated . <br/> BOPP matte film (inner side BOPP matte film) included 15 microns bopp matte film, 18microns Polypropylene matte film, 20microns BOPP matte laminating film <br/> BOPP film,Polypropylene film,BOPP FOIL,OPP packing film, BOPP printing film, BOPP matte film, BOPP thermal film,OPP heat sealable film,corona treated film, 28 microns tape film , bopp bag film ,bopp glossy film, bopp pearlized film ,bopp metallize film,bopp white film, bopp food package film, bopp anti static film,<br/> Low gloss and high haze; perfect printing performance ;excellent heat sealing performance.<br/> Assumes the diffuse reflection, the eye feeling is gentle, the printing effect is good, completely obviously noble, comfortable feel well, if the paper resembles the silk, the other side features same printable &amp;composite. Application : Laminate with paper for book or magazine, gift bags too , As well can be used for package box of soap ,food ,cigarette ,cosmetics and medical products.</p> <p><br/></p>', '2026-09-06 20:58:45');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO cms_items (c_id, i_id, title, pic, content, addtime) VALUES (48, 186, 'Double sides Heat sealable Polypropylene film', '../upload/image/20180922/20180922163509_40805.jpg', '<p></p><p><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"><strong>Heat sealable Polypropylene film BOPP film</strong></span></p> <p></p><p><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">two-side coated, sealable OPP film used primarily as the outside web in laminations. Are sealable to other acrylic-coated and sealable PVdC-coated films. Arcylic coating and its properties are not affected by humidity.</span></p> <p><br/></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;"> <b><u><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:underline;">FILM TECHNICAL SPECS:</span></u></b></p> <table border="1" cellspacing="0" style="margin:auto auto auto 5pt;border:currentColor;width:505.45pt;border-collapse:collapse;"> <tbody> <tr> <td style="background:#81709E;border:1pt outset #666666;" valign="center" width="132"> <p align="center" style="text-align:center;"> <b><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;font-weight:bold;">Properties</span></b></p> </td> <td style="background:#81709E;" valign="center" width="141"> <p align="center" style="text-align:center;"> <b><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;font-weight:bold;">unit</span></b></p> </td> <td style="background:#81709E;" valign="center" width="130"> <p align="center" style="text-align:center;"> <b><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;font-weight:bold;">Test method</span></b></p> </td> <td style="background:#81709E;" valign="center" width="99"> <p align="center" style="text-align:center;"> <b><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;font-weight:bold;">Tolerance</span></b></p> </td> <td style="background:#81709E;" valign="center" width="170"> <p align="center" style="text-align