:#ECE4F9;" valign="center" width="170"> <p align="center" style="text-align:center;"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">2200</span></p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style="background:#9F8FBA;" valign="center" width="132"> <p><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Heat Seal </span><span style="color:#000000;font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;"><br/> </span><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Ring</span></p> </td> <td style="background:#CBBCE3;" valign="center" width="141"> <p align="center" style="text-align:center;"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">ºC</span></p> </td> <td style="background:#CBBCE3;" valign="center" width="130"> <p align="center" style="text-align:center;"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">OPMA METHOD</span></p> </td> <td style="background:#CBBCE3;" valign="center" width="99"> <p align="center" style="text-align:center;"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">--</span></p> </td> <td style="background:#ECE4F9;" valign="center" width="170"> <p align="center" style="text-align:center;"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">120 -145</span></p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style="background:#9F8FBA;" valign="center" width="132"> <p><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Density</span></p> </td> <td style="background:#CBBCE3;" valign="center" width="141"> <p align="center" style="text-align:center;"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Kgm/m³</span></p> </td> <td style="background:#CBBCE3;" valign="center" width="130"> <p align="center" style="text-align:center;"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">ASTM D 1505</span></p> </td> <td style="background:#CBBCE3;" valign="center" width="99"> <p align="center" style="text-align:center;"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">± 0.05</span></p> </td> <td style="background:#ECE4F9;" valign="center" width="170"> <p align="center" style="text-align:center;"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">0.91</span></p> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p></p> <p><b></b></p> <p align="center" style="text-align:center;"> <b><u><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:underline;">FILM DESCRIPTION:</span></u></b></p> <p><span style="color:#E53333;line-height:150%;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Two sides heat sealable; one side treated co extruded biaxial oriented polypropylene transparent film, suitable for:</span></p> <ul> <li style="color:#000000;font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> <p style=''color:#000000;font-family:"font-size:12pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;''> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Rotogravure</span><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"> and flexographic printing. </span></p>', '2026-09-06 20:58:45');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO cms_items (c_id, i_id, title, pic, content, addtime) VALUES (48, 185, 'BOPP Film (3-75 microns)', '../upload/image/20180925/20180925220111_26191.jpg', '<p></p><p>BOPP Film (3-75 microns)</p> <p>BOPP film (BOPP FOIL) is a packing film with a superior mechanical nature, transparent and moisture proof formed through the processing of draft Bi-axially Oriented Polypropylene (BOPP) vertically and horizontally.<br/> BOPP film including BOPP plain film ( BOPP flower film,BOPP tape-grade film,BOPP clothes/bag-grade film,BOPP mini/smaller roll,BOPP anti-static film);BOPP tobacco film; BOPP heat sealable film;BOPP matte film; BOPP pearlized film;BOPP thermal film; BOPP capacitor film;BOPP Sheets; BOPP anti-fog film; BOPP micro/ macro perforated film; Metallized BOPP film (VMBOPP); BOPP tear tape;BOPP laser film and so on. Featuring details : <br/> Main Properties,High transparency and gloss<br/> High tensile strength,High grease barrier<br/> Excellent ink and coating adhesion,Low static electricity<br/> Superior thickness uniformity,Smooth rolling and neat ends of film rolls<br/> Specifications:Thickness:12-52 micron Width:350-1600 mm Length:1000-18000M<br/> BOPP film (Polypropylene film) is widely used for plain, lamination, matte and metalized films which are used for many different sorts selection of applications,such as carton box, flower, gift, food, confectionery, lamination,CD,DVD, VCD,cigarette,and box packaging, packing tape, etc according to its purpose such as printing, clothes, tape and laminating which are used for many different sorts of applications as the selection follow. Customized dimensions and specifications are available upon request.</p>', '2026-09-06 20:58:45');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO cms_items (c_id, i_id, title, pic, content, addtime) VALUES (48, 184, 'OPP bags for clothes packing and for office things packing', '../upload/image/20181227/20181227103916_35296.jpg', '<p></p><p><span style="color:#009900;font-family:Verdana;">OPP bags for clothes packing and for office things packing</span></p> <p><span style="color:#009900;font-family:Verdana;">We manufacturer all kinds of BOPP bags(clear/transparent,color and printed logos )and PE bags in roll and in sheets for clothes packing and for office things packing . We have 14 production lines for producing all kinds of bags.BOPP bags for clothes packing and for office things packing, printed bags,logo bags</span><br/> <span style="color:#009900;font-family:Verdana;"> BOPP Basg with self adhesive tape in sheets </span><br/> <span style="color:#009900;font-family:Verdana;"> Sizes such as: 25 mic*(340MM+40MM) *260mm or 25.4CM *35.2CM unit-(clear packing: 1000piece/bag, and 20bags/carton) package : Standard export package with carton and pallets .</span></p> <p><br/></p>', '2026-09-06 20:58:45');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO cms_items (c_id, i_id, title, pic, content, addtime) VALUES (48, 165, 'Bopp flower wrapping film in smaller rolls', '../upload/image/20180922/20180922163619_63577.jpg', '<p><br/></p><p><span style="font-size:18px;color:#009900;">Bopp flower wrapping film</span></p> <p><span style="font-size:18px;color:#009900;">Bopp flower wrapping film (BOPP foil or BOPP paper or superclear cellophane) in smaller rolls</span><br/> <span style="font-size:18px;color:#009900;">Thickness: 15-50UM (Microns) for example: 20 25 30 35 40 Microns</span><br/> <span style="font-size:18px;color:#009900;">Width: 90-1200MM ( such as: 500,550,600,650,700,750,800,850,950,1050,1100mm..)</span><br/> <span style="font-size:18px;color:#009900;">Length: 20,50,60,80,120,180,200,250,300,400,500,1000M</span><br/> <span style="font-size:18px;color:#009900;">Usage: Used for packing all kinds of flowers </span><br/> <span style="font-size:18px;color:#009900;">Color: Super clear transparent or red, pink, green, white, purple, blue or printed customer''s private logos.</span><br/> <span style="font-size:18px;color:#009900;">Material: BOPP clear transparent film, Silver metalized BOPP film, logo designs printed BOPP film, laser holographic film. And BOPP silver golden color film, and so forth</span><br/> <span style="font-size:18px;color:#009900;">Bopp flower wrapping film, BOPP jumbo rolls slit into the smaller rolls, and the smaller roll can be any nominated thickness, and nominated width and any nominated length, and any nominated inner paper tube core, for example: 3.0" ,2.0",1.0" . usually buyer order the smaller rolls and nominated/fixed the roll net weight and gross weight. </span><br/> <span style="font-size:18px;color:#009900;">Packing: use carton and for size 30Mic*650mm*60M ,usually 12rolls/carton </span><br/> <span style="font-size:18px;color:#009900;">For size: 30Mic*650mm*200M,usually 4rolls/carton</span><br/> <span style="font-size:18px;color:#009900;">For size: 30Mic*650mm*400M,usually 2rolls/carton</span><br/> <span style="font-size:18px;color:#009900;">Inner core: 1.0" 1.5" 1.8" 2.0" 2.5" 3.0" inches. </span><br/> <span style="font-size:18px;color:#009900;">Two end of the core will use the plastic insert to protect the rolls.</span></p> <p><strong><span style="color:#009900;font-size:18px;">See below PDF link For more details photos:</span></strong></p> <p><a class="ke-insertfile" href="../upload/file/20180925225120_59419.pdf" target="_blank"><strong><span style="color:#009900;font-size:18px;">Asia Pacific -details photos of BOPP Flower wrapping film-compressed.pdf</span></strong></a></p> <p><br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/></p> <p><strong><span style="color:#009900;font-family:Verdana;font-size:16px;">See below PDF link For more details photos: </span></strong></p> <p><a class="ke-insertfile" href="../upload/file/20180925225120_59419.pdf" target="_blank"><strong><span style="color:#337FE5;font-family:Verdana;font-size:16px;">Asia Pacific -details photos of BOPP Flower wrapping film-compressed.pdf</span></strong></a></p>', '2026-09-06 20:58:45');